Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 17:36:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 24/42] amdgpu: execute BF16 Triton SiluAndMul

Admit the exact gfx950 BF16 SiluAndMul image for decode and masked-prefill
shapes, execute its missing packed and divide semantics, and retain exact
numeric, PC, memory, and reusable-session lifecycle evidence. Preserve the
accepted CP26 generic, CP27 OpenCL, and CP29 Triton vecadd paths.

